abstract: >-
  Prototype Solidity contract, static registration page, and scripts that record
  only SHA-256 fingerprints of an agent's identity document (SOUL) versions as a
  parent-linked chain, with optional carry-over score records and free EIP-712
  signed Merkle batches. Testnet only. No token, no document content on chain.
